## Absolute origin of the backend. In production this MUST be the full Render URL
## (e.g. https://sasbo-online-backend-latest-docker.onrender.com) so the browser
## calls Render directly. Leaving it empty makes apiUrl() emit relative /api paths,
## which only work behind a same-origin proxy — this project does not use one.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
